<title>USA: EIS Int'l names Frederick Foley as CFO.</title>
<headline>EIS Int'l names Frederick Foley as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>EIS International Inc said it named Frederick Foley as its chief financial officer to replace Herbert Balzuweit, who will leave the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Foley has been with EIS for six years, the company said in a press statement.</p>
<p>His most recent position was as senior vice president of finance for EIS' EIS Systems unit.</p>
</text>
